OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh inquiry told gardai warned
OL,4,ARUC of car bomb crossing border
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Omagh Bombing Inquiry has heard
OL,7,Fthat the gardai (Irish Police) warned
OL,8,Fthe Northern Ireland security forces
OL,9,Fthat a car bomb was to cross the border
OL,10,Fthe day before the atrocity.
OL,12,FIn response to the warning the police
OL,13,Fin Northern Ireland carried out a
OL,14,F"proactive police operation" in Newry,
OL,15,Fwhich they believed might be the route
OL,16,Fto a target.
OL,18,FThe Omagh bomb crossed over from the
OL,19,FRepublic into Northern Ireland at
OL,20,FAughnacloy in County Tyrone.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
