OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh inquiry told gardai warned
OL,4,ARUC of car bomb crossing border
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the inquiry resumed hearing evidence
OL,7,Fin Belfast on Monday, counsel for the
OL,8,Finquiry outlined the evidence to be
OL,9,Fheard over the next week.
